'''Medama-Oyaji''' (目玉おやじ, Lit. "Eyeball Father") is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that was implemented in [[Version 8.1 Update|Version 8.1]] and can be obtained during the [[Yuru-i GeGeGe no Kitarou: Youkai Dotabata Daisensou Collaboration Event]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 454
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Medama-Oyaji
|name2 = Bathing Oyaji
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Bathing Oyaji''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Oyaji's pitiful stats make him unusable past early [[Empire of Cats]] [[Zombie Outbreaks|Outbreaks]]. His most noticeably weakness is his abysmal cooldown, comparable to the cooldown of certain [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rares]]! Although his [[Weaken]] effect has well over 100% uptime, his low HP allows Zombies to burrow onto him and flank him easily. Lastly, his anti-Metal ability is more than disappointing. With its 4% chance, you'll hardly ever see a Critical Hit from him.

{{Job|Classification = Crowd-Controller & Critter}}

